WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.313
The Microsoft 365 audit log is the plane
most often assumed and least often checked.

2
00:00:06.313 --> 00:00:10.445
Verify it's actually on, and do it
in the right PowerShell session,

3
00:00:10.445 --> 00:00:12.862
because the other one always says off.

4
00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:17.989
Collecting it through Microsoft's API has
a few rules that break almost every first

5
00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:22.446
attempt: patience when you subscribe,
a seven-day window to fetch content,

6
00:00:22.446 --> 00:00:25.938
events that arrive out of order,
and duplicates by design.

7
00:00:25.938 --> 00:00:29.354
So the collector tracks what
it's fetched, deduplicates,

8
00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:32.250
and looks back over a
trailing window every run.

9
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.540
Then there's how long Microsoft keeps it.
